{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54639","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密云见，踊跃若倾河。\n或（辛本作「忽」）有雷声先大作，其时有雨也无多，说处莫（川本作「没」）偏颇（辛本作「说出遍遍无。\n」）（按：首本此处缺一页，以下五首据辛本补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}